Bind Npc 14424 Zone 12
Quest 351 "Nightmare"
    Journal "Get rid of the cause of the nightmare hidden in the northeast forest of Eslant, and regain peace!"
    Kill 80 of 7016, 9622 at direction_172

Requires player level >= 80 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 83750000 experience

direction_172 = location "Booro" about "Buro" found "Eslant" at 840 900 in zone 12

On available
    Say "Master, it's said that something strange is going on in Eslant. Please go to [Ascetic] Tabeth and ask."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Nights here in Eslant are getting more and more fearful. Citizens here are suffering from a monster in their dreams every night..."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Given the shape of the monster, I suspect it's a Buro, a monster living in the northeastern part of the forest. They're said to be capable of real magic, but who knows? If they're the real cause of the nightmares, they should be removed..."

On in_progress
    Say "Where's the end of the nightmares..."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_172

On ready
    Say "Eslant is not suffering from nightmares any more, is it?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "After you got rid of Buro, no one is suffering from nightmares any more. Thank you!"
